ready: 1
kind: quality
id: capture.quality.no-loss
display_id: QC-CAPTURE-NO-LOSS
module: capture
title: Complete session records are never lost
applies_to:
  - capture.seq.ingest
measure: Complete records in a connected runtime's session files that never become events while the runtime still keeps them.
target: >-
  None. Every complete record becomes exactly one event within one catch-up after the daemon
  runs, whatever hooks were missed or ingestion errors happened earlier.
